WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.600
The pivot is close to the rock; you push far from it.

2
00:00:04.151 --> 00:00:08.676
The rock is close to the pivot. Your push is three times as far away.

3
00:00:09.455 --> 00:00:12.055
So a third of the force is enough.

4
00:00:16.626 --> 00:00:19.901
But your hand moves three times as far as the rock.
